nce to each verified landing, while retaining\nthe complete visible board (except the move meter) in search state keys. The\nexisting navigate_switchable_platforms leg suffices without a new mechanic-\nspecific leg. The final three actions [4,2,2] increase clone levels_completed\nfrom 3 to 4; intermediate waypoint arrivals keep the reward at 3.\n\nReproduction: run the named bounded foreground probe scripts. Their outputs\nare compact component summaries or action paths, not hidden runtime state.\nTXT'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
